@startuml 01-buyer-commercial-intent
title Domain Story 1 — Buyer Commercial Intent
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "B2B Buyer" as Buyer
participant "Buyer Surface" as Surface
participant "Sales Commitment" as Sales
participant "Catalog & Commercial Policy" as Catalog
participant "Inventory Availability" as Inventory
participant "Credit & Receivables" as Credit

Buyer -> Surface : Select visible SKU and Customer Account context
Surface -> Sales : Submit direct order or Purchase Request
Sales -> Catalog : Validate authoritative price and policy
Sales -> Inventory : Evaluate current sellability
Sales -> Credit : Evaluate hard-block credit decision
alt accepted
  Sales -> Sales : Establish Commercial Commitment
  Sales --> Surface : Commercial outcome
else conflict
  Sales --> Surface : Explicit conflict
end

note over Surface,Sales
Cart is not a Commercial Commitment.
The Buyer never receives a silently substituted SKU.
end note
@enduml
